# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MD TRADER OS — environment
#
# Every value here is read SERVER-SIDE ONLY. No key is ever exposed to the
# browser. The application runs with none of these set: it starts in a clearly
# labelled DEMO DATA MODE and says so on every screen.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# REQUIRED IN PRODUCTION — signs the session cookie. Generate with:
#   node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(48).toString('base64url'))"
AUTH_SECRET=

# ── Market data: OANDA (recommended if you trade with them) ──────────────────
# Returns YOUR BROKER'S OWN PRICES, so the app matches the charts you already
# look at instead of merely being close. Covers every tradable market in this
# app — all 28 forex pairs, the index futures, metals and energy (42 of 45).
#
# Get a token: OANDA account -> Manage API Access -> Generate. No account ID
# needed. OANDA_ENVIRONMENT must match the account the token came from.
OANDA_API_TOKEN=
OANDA_ENVIRONMENT=practice        # practice | live

# ── Market data: Twelve Data (optional) ──────────────────────────────────────
# Only needed for the three REFERENCE markets OANDA does not carry: the dollar
# index, VIX and the US 10-year yield. They feed the cross-market and regime
# reads. Metered, so it is restricted to MD_LIVE_SYMBOLS.
# Free key: https://twelvedata.com/pricing (free tier = 8 requests/min, 800/day).
TWELVE_DATA_API_KEY=

# Which markets Twelve Data serves live (OANDA ignores this — everything it
# covers runs live). Comma separated, using this app's own symbols.
# MD_LIVE_SYMBOLS=DXY,VIX,US10Y

# Request budget for Twelve Data. The app refuses a call before making it once
# these are hit, so an exhausted plan degrades to demo data with an explanation.
# MD_API_PER_MINUTE=8
# MD_API_PER_DAY=800

# How long live data is held before refetching. Each screen always shows the
# true age of what it displays.
# MD_INTRADAY_TTL_MS=900000     # 15 minutes
# MD_DAILY_TTL_MS=21600000      # 6 hours
# MD_QUOTE_TTL_MS=60000         # 1 minute

# ── Access ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# There is no sign-in. The journal, plan, vision board and every other personal
# feature are stored in each visitor's own browser.
MD_PUBLIC_MODE=true

# ── Economic calendar ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Release times for the calendar and event risk. Without it, demo events are
# shown and labelled. Implements EconomicCalendarProvider.
FMP_API_KEY=

# ── AI (the Market Analyst and the WHY explanations) ─────────────────────────
# Either provider works; Anthropic takes precedence when both are set. With
# neither, the deterministic explanation engine answers from the same structured
# analysis data — the feature degrades, it does not break.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# LLM_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5

# ── Payments ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Without these, plan changes run through a clearly labelled demo upgrade so the
# paywall → upgrade → entitlement flow is testable end to end.
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
STRIPE_PRICE_PRO=
STRIPE_PRICE_ELITE=

# ── Storage ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The default store is a JSON file under ./data. prisma/schema.prisma is the
# PostgreSQL production target — implement the same store interface on Prisma and
# nothing above src/lib/db/store.ts changes.
# MD_DATA_DIR=./data
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/md_trader_os
